[00:20.80]We really want to imitate our God,
[00:24.94]To be impartial, as we know he is.
[00:30.30]To save all sorts of people is his will;
[00:35.10]He welcomes all to come and to be his.
[00:40.75](Chorus)
[00:40.90]It’s the person, not the place;
[00:43.42]It’s the heart and not the face.
[00:46.32]God’s message to all people we extend.
[00:50.92]So because we really care,
[00:53.42]We keep preaching ev’rywhere:
[00:55.94]“All sorts of people can become God’s friend.”
[01:09.30]It doesn’t matter where they may be found
[01:12.60]Or what at first they might appear to be.
[01:18.06]What really counts is what they are at heart—
[01:23.92]The inner self, the one Jehovah sees.
[01:29.25](Chorus)
[01:29.40]It’s the person, not the place;
[01:31.96]It’s the heart and not the face.
[01:34.80]God’s message to all people we extend.
[01:39.58]So because we really care,
[01:42.08]We keep preaching ev’rywhere:
[01:44.42]“All sorts of people can become God’s friend.”
[01:57.78]Jehovah welcomes all who make the choice
[02:00.84]To leave the world and all its ways behind.
[02:06.70]This we have learned, and this we want to share,
[02:12.28]And so we preach to people of all kinds.
[02:17.79](Chorus)
[02:17.94]It’s the person, not the place;
[02:20.26]It’s the heart and not the face.
[02:23.40]God’s message to all people we extend.
[02:28.00]So because we really care,
[02:30.60]We keep preaching ev’rywhere:
[02:32.92]“All sorts of people can become God’s friend.”
